---
import Venn from "../../assets/svg/venn.svg";
---

<section class="page mt-24 grid items-center gap-12 lg:mt-32 lg:grid-cols-2">
  <div class="reveal max-w-[35rem] space-y-8 text-intro lg:pl-6">
    <p>
      → Future-tech designer &amp; product owner with 10+ years of experience transforming complex
      systems into desirable, feasible, and viable products: combining data and creativity to discover
      the “<em>What</em>” and engineer the “<em>How</em>.”
    </p>
    <p>→ Thriving in cross-functional teams where design becomes the catalyst for innovation that scales.</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="reveal mx-auto w-full max-w-[460px]">
    <Venn
      class="h-auto w-full"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Venn diagram: where Desirable, Feasible and Viable overlap"
    />
  </figure>
</section>
